WEBVTT

20:30.714 --> 20:32.716
Is my mother alive?

20:33.425 --> 20:37.012
Does she know about me?
Where I am, where I'm going?

20:38.055 --> 20:39.723
Does she care?

20:41.058 --> 20:44.019
The next time we see each other,

20:44.144 --> 20:46.188
we'll talk about your mother.

20:46.313 --> 20:48.065
Hmm?

20:48.190 --> 20:49.650
I promise.
